      "description": "Turn the photos already on your phone into professional portraits, creative AI images, and videos made to share. Trusted by millions of users worldwide, Momo is an AI Photo & Video Maker that brings AI photos, headshots, dance videos, hairstyle transformations, selfie edits, and more together in one place. \n\nUpload a photo, choose what you want to make, and let Momo do the rest. Refresh your profile photo, explore a new hairstyle, or turn a selfie into a realistic portrait.\n\n【 AI PHOTOS & VIDEOS IN ONE APP 】\nAI Photo Maker\nTransform your own photos into realistic AI images, polished portraits, and creative visual styles for social media, profiles, and everyday sharing.\n\nAI Video Maker\nBring photos to life with AI-generated motion, video effects, and creative video styles designed for easy sharing.\n\nAI Dance Videos\nTurn your photo into an animated dance video. Pick a style and see your image move with AI-generated choreography.\n\nProfessional AI Headshots\nGenerate polished headshots for resumes, business profiles, professional pages, and social media without arranging a traditional photoshoot.\n\nHairstyle Changer\nPreview different hairstyles using your own photo and explore new looks before making a change.\n\nSelfie Editor\nRefresh selfies with AI-powered edits designed to enhance the overall look of your photo while keeping the process simple.\n\n Realistic AI Photos\nTurn everyday selfies into high-quality portraits and explore realistic, artistic, and creative photo styles inspired by your own images.\n\n【 MADE FOR YOUR PHOTOS 】\nMomo starts with the photos you already have. Upload an image and explore different ways to transform it without complicated editing tools.\nUse Momo for:\n• Professional profile and business headshots\n• AI dance and animated videos\n• Hairstyle previews and new looks\n• Realistic AI portraits\n• Creative photo and video effects\n\n【 SIMPLE TO CREATE, EASY TO SHARE 】\nNo advanced editing skills are needed. Choose a photo, select a photo or video experience, and explore your result. Save the AI photos and videos you like and share them on your favorite social platforms.\n\nNew styles, video experiences, and creative tools are regularly added so there is always another way to explore your photos.\nFrom a professional headshot to a fun AI dance video, Momo gives you one place to transform photos, experiment with new looks, and bring your favorite images to life.\n\nMomo offers optional auto-renewable subscriptions for premium features. Features may require a paid subscription.\nPayment is charged to your Apple ID at purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel your subscription in your App Store account settings.\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://momoai.co/privacy\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://momoai.co/terms\nQuestions? Contact us:\ninfo@momoai.co",
